\par }{\b\f21\fs22 \'a7\'e9c l\'cbp - T\'f9 do - H\'b9nh ph\'f3c}{\f20 \cell }\pard \nowidctlpar\widctlpar\intbl\adjustright {\f20 \row }\trowd \trgaph108\trleft-630 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb \cellx1980\clvertalt\cltxlrtb \cellx2295\clvertalt\cltxlrtb \cellx8595
